                                                STARMAP-X:  68     STARMAP-Y:  66     ORBIT#> 1                                                                                 M" THE ONLY THING DECIPHERABLE IN SOME ALIEN WRITINGS ARE PLANETARY COORDINATES - NO. 14 - ." >MSG                                                                                                                                                              \ PLANETSIDE CLUES                                                                                                              M" AMIDST PILES OF ALIEN BOOKS SOME WRITING FROM THE OLD EMPIRE - ...THE PYTHAGORAS CONSTELLATION AT 216,87..." >MSG                                                                            STARMAP-X: 125     STARMAP-Y: 100     ORBIT#> 5                 MTYPE: RANDOM                                                                                                                   M" MICROFILM - ...REASON TO BELIEVE THERE IS A BLACK EGG DEVICE IN SOME PHLEGMAK RUINS AT - NO.  4 - ON THE THIRD PLANET OF SYSTEM 238,189..." >MSG                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \ PLANETSIDE CLUES                                              STARMAP-X: 123     STARMAP-Y: 101     ORBIT#> 1                                                                                 M" REPORT - TO COLONY CONTROL AT - NO. 15 -, PLANET 4, SYSTEM 118,146 - DUE TO THE INCREASED DEMAND FOR QUADRO-TRITICALE AND A RECENT INFESTATION OF SMALL FURY CREATURES WHICH HAVE DEPLETED OUR STOCK WE..." >MSG                                                                                                             STARMAP-X: 118     STARMAP-Y: 146     ORBIT#> 5                 MTYPE: SPECIFIC                                                 PLANET-X: 001      PLANET-Y: 001                                                                                                M" INTELLIGENCE COMMUNICATION - ...SHIP WAS ATTACKED BY THE GAZURTOID. ALL CREW WERE KILLED AND THE NEW CLOAKING DEVICE WAS STOLEN. A PROBE WAS ABLE TO TRACK THEIR SHIP'S TACHYON TRAIL TO THE FIRST PLANET IN SYSTEM 68,66. OTHER THAN THAT WE DON'T..." >MSG \ PLANETSIDE CLUES                                                                                                              STARMAP-X: 143     STARMAP-Y: 115     ORBIT#> 5                 MTYPE: SPECIFIC                                                 PLANET-X: 001      PLANET-Y: 001                                M" RECONNAISSANCE REPORT - TO OFFENSIVE HEADQUARTERS AT - NO. 12 - ON MARDAN 2 - FIGHTING BETWEEN THE VELOX AND GAZURTOID IS STILL HEATED. WE HAVE BEEN KEEPING A LOW PROFILE AND..." >MSG                                                                      STARMAP-X: 175     STARMAP-Y:  94     ORBIT#> 3                 MTYPE: SPECIFIC                                                 PLANET-X: 001      PLANET-Y: 001                                M" CAPTAINS LOG ENTRY - OCTOBER 31, 3480 - WE HAVE MANAGED TO SET UP A CAMP OF SORTS HERE, AND HAVE ENOUGH SUPPLIES TO KEEP US ALIVE FOR SEVERAL MONTHS. WE WERE ON OUR WAY TO ESTABLISH THE NOAH 9 COLONY WORLD OF 'HEAVEN' WHEN THE SHIP BLEW." >MSG          \ PLANETSIDE CLUES                                                                                                              PLANET-X: 001      PLANET-Y: 001                                                                                                M" THE MECHANS ARE CURRENTLY IN PREPARATION PHASE CODE BLUE. OUR ARRIVAL WOULD HAVE INITIATED CODE RED, AND WE WOULD HAVE TAKEN CONTOL OF THE MECHANS. I BELIEVE OUR SHIP WAS SABATOGED BY THE LAYTONITES, DAMN THEM. HALF OF MY CREW IS DEAD." >MSG                                                                            M" THEIR BOMB BLEW OUT THE ENTIRE AFT QUARTER SECTION OF THE SHIP. I DON'T KNOW HOW WE MADE IT DOWN TO THE SURFACE IN THAT DEFECTIVE POD. I JUST HOPE OUR LUCK HOLDS OUT. CAPTAIN OUT." >MSG                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \ PLANETSIDE CLUES                                                                                                              STARMAP-X: 164     STARMAP-Y:  85     ORBIT#> 8                 MTYPE: RANDOM                                                                                                                   M" SIGN - RONALD PETER GAAL MEMORIAL RESEARCH STATION." >MSG                                                                    STARMAP-X: 165     STARMAP-Y:  84     ORBIT#> 8                 MTYPE: SPECIFIC                                                 PLANET-X: 001      PLANET-Y: 001                                                                                                M" REPORT - PROJECT TELEPORT, 1-2-3380 - ...IN SHORT WE HAVE DEVISED A SCHEME TO TELEPORT AN OPERATIVE FROM A SPECIALLY BUILT STARBASE ( WHICH WILL BE KNOWN AS CRYSTAL BASE 1 ) TO THE SURFACE OF THE CRYSTAL PLANET." >MSG                                                                                                    \ PLANETSIDE CLUES                                                                                                              M" BECAUSE OF THE PROBLEMS INVOLVED WITH A TELEPORTATION OF THIS DISTANCE WE WILL NOT BE ABLE TO RETRIEVE THE OPERATIVE. THE VOLUNTEER WILL BE SENT IN WITH A NUCLEAR EXPLOSIVE. IF POSSIBILE HE WILL STAY IN COMMUNICATION WITH THE STARBASE." >MSG'                                                                           M" HE WILL LOCATE AND DESTROY THE CONTROL CENTER OF THE CRYSTAL PLANET. POTENTIAL PROBLEMS INCLUDE - TELPORTATION RELIABLILTY, INSUFFICIENT EXPLOSIVE POWER, COMMUNICATIONS THROUGH THE MAGNETIC FIELD GENERATED BY THE PLANET, LOCATION OF..." >MSG'                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \ PLANETSIDE CLUES                                                                                                              M" COMMUNICATION TRANSCRIPT - CRYSTAL BASE 1 TO AKTERON INSTITUTE, 8-8-3382   ...BEEN 14 HOURS SINCE COMMANDER MC CONNELL WAS SENT DOWN. AT NO POINT HAVE WE RECEIVED ANY COMMUNICATION FROM HIM." >MSG'                                                                                                                        M" AT EXACTLY 12 HRS AND 11 MINUTES AFTER HIS DEPARTURE WE WITNESSED AN EXPLOSION ON THE PLANET'S SURFACE. WE ARE NOW SENDING OUT DRONES TO TEST THE DEFENSES OF THE CRYSTAL PLANET IN AN ATTEMPT TO ASCERTAIN THE EFFECT OF THE EXPLOSION..." >MSG'                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            \ PLANETSIDE CLUES                                                                                                              M" RESEARCH COUNCIL RECOMMENDATION 5-5-3386 - ...THEREFORE IT IS OUR FINDING THAT THE ONLY EFFECTIVE MEANS OF DESTROYING THE CRYSTAL PLANET IS WITH THE USE OF 3 DEVICES. THE FIRST OF THESE, THE CRYSTAL ORB, IS NEEDED TO NULLIFY THE DEFENSES OF THE PLANET." >MSG'                                                                                                                          M" THIS IS IN THE POSSESSION OF THE VELOX AND IS KNOWN TO THEM AS THE SMALL EGG. THE SECOND DEVICE IS THE CRYSTAL CONE. THIS IS NEEDED TO INDENTIFY FROM ORBIT THE LOCATION OF THE CONTROL NEXUS. THE REST OF THE CRYSTAL PLANET IS TOO INVULNERABLE." >MSG'                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \ PLANETSIDE CLUES                                                                                                              M" WE NOW KNOW THIS DEVICE TO BE AT - NO. 13 - ON THE FIRST PLANET IN THE SYSTEM 20,198. UNFORTUNATELY THIS IS DEEP IN UHLEK SPACE. LASTLY, A BOMB OF SUFFICIENT EXPLOSIVE POWER IS REQUIRED."  >MSG'                                                                                                                           M" THE ACTUAL FORCE NECESSARY IS UNKNOWN BUT OUR BEST ESTIMATES INDICATE SOMETHING ON THE ORDER OF BEVA-TONS." >MSG'                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            \ PLANETSIDE CLUES                                                                                                              STARMAP-X: 192     STARMAP-Y: 152     ORBIT#> 5                 MTYPE: SPECIFIC                                                 PLANET-X: 001      PLANET-Y: 001                                                                                                M" LOG ENTRY, 8-8-3382, COMMANDER MCCONNELL, ENTRY 1 - I HAVE SUCCESSFULLY TELEPORTED TO THE CRYSTAL PLANET! I AM DIZZY AND HAVE EXPERIENCED A PROFOUND SENSE OF DISORIENTAION BUT OTHER THAN THAT I SEEM TO BE FINE. THE CONTROL NEXUS IS VISIBLE FROM HERE."  >MSG                                                                                                                            M" ENTRY 2 - IT WOULD SEEM THAT THE ELECTRO-MAGNETIC FIELD AROUND THE CRYSTAL PLANET IS, IN FACT, BLOCKING COMMUNICATIONS SINCE IT HAS BEEN AN HOUR AND I HAVE STILL RECIEVED NO TRANSMISSION FROM CRYSTAL BASE 1." >MSG'                                       \ PLANETSIDE CLUES                                                                                                              M" ENTRY 2 CONT. - I AM THEREFORE WRITING IN THIS LOG AS PLANNED, AND WILL ATTEMPT TO FIND A SAFE PLACE FOR IT BEFOR THE EXPLOSION." >MSG'                                                                                                                      M" ENTRY 3 - I HAVE REACHED THE CONTROL CENTER AND HAVE SET THE CHARGES. IT APPEARS TO BE A MASSIVE RUIN OF THE ANCIENTS. THE QUEER CRYSTALLINE LUMPS OF ENDURIUM ARE EVERYWHERE HERE." >MSG'                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \ PLANETSIDE CLUES                                                                                                              M" ENTRY 4 - I HAVE JUST HAD AN ASTOUNDING EXPERIENCE! I CAN HARDLY BELIEVE IT BUT I SEEM TO HAVE MADE TELEPATHIC CONTACT WITH THE ANCIENTS. THEY ARE HERE! ON THE CRYSTAL PLANET, CONTROLLING IT!" >MSG'                                                                                                                       M" ENTRY 4 CONT. - I WISH THERE WAS SOME WAY FOR ME TO COMMUNICATE WHAT I HAVE FOUND. THE EXPLOSION IS SET FOR T-MINUS 40 MINUTES. IN THE EVENT THAT THE CRYSTAL PLANET IS NOT DESTROYED, I CAN ONLY HOPE THAT THIS LOG IS FOUND BY SOMEONE." >MSG'                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \ PLANETSIDE CLUES                                                                                                              M" ENTRY 4 CONT.- THE ANCIENTS ARE ENDURIUM! THOSE WEIRD LUMPS ARE ACTUALLY INTELLIGENT LIFE, AND WE HAVE SPENT HUNDREDS OF YEARS HUNTING THEM TO BURN FOR FUEL IN OUR SHIPS!" >MSG'                                                                            M" ENTRY 4 CONT.- THEIR METABOLISM IS SO MUCH SLOWER THAN OURS THEY LIVE IN AN ENTIRELY DIFFERENT TIME FRAMEWORK. I DON'T THINK THEY EVEN KNOW WE ARE SENTIENT. I BELIEVE IT WAS ONLY BECAUSE OF A LINK THRU THE CRYSTAL PLANET THAT CONTACT WAS MADE AT ALL."   >MSG'                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          \ PLANETSIDE CLUES                                                                                                              M" ENTRY 4 CONT.- THIS CRYSTAL PLANET WAS THEIR LAST DEFENSE. I CAN HARDLY BLAME THEM. CARBON BASED LIFE MUST HAVE SEEMED SOMETHING LIKE A VIRUS TO THEM. JUST THE SAME, I HOPE THE EXPLOSION WORKS. IT LOOKS LIKE AT THIS POINT ITS US OR THEM. MCCONNELL OUT." >MSG'                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          }SPACE                                                                                                                          forget dest-x                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   